<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">Personal Blog / Electronic Information Engineering</p>
    <h1>把专业学习、板级设计和生活碎片，整理成自己的长期档案。</h1>
    <p class="hero-text">这里不是只放课程笔记的地方。它会同时收纳电子信息工程相关的学习记录、PCB 设计过程、项目复盘，以及摄影、模型和日常观察。</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="button primary" href="<%- url_for('/notes/') %>">学习笔记</a>
      <a class="button ghost" href="<%- url_for('/life/') %>">生活记录</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <aside class="signal-panel" aria-label="site modules">
    <div class="panel-top">
      <span>SITE MAP</span>
      <b>V0.2</b>
    </div>
    <div class="orbit-map">
      <span class="core">BLOG</span>
      <span class="node n1">Notes</span>
      <span class="node n2">PCB</span>
      <span class="node n3">Projects</span>
      <span class="node n4">Life</span>
    </div>
    <div class="metric-grid">
      <div><span>Study</span><strong>Notes</strong></div>
      <div><span>Hardware</span><strong>PCB</strong></div>
      <div><span>Build</span><strong>Projects</strong></div>
      <div><span>Personal</span><strong>Life</strong></div>
    </div>
  </aside>
</section>

<section class="module-section">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">Reserved Modules</p>
    <h2>先把栏目分清楚，内容以后慢慢填。</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="module-grid">
    <a class="module-card feature-notes" href="<%- url_for('/notes/') %>">
      <span>01</span>
      <strong>学习笔记</strong>
      <small>电路、信号与系统、通信原理、单片机、DSP、FPGA、GNSS 等课程和复习材料。</small>
    </a>
    <a class="module-card feature-pcb" href="<%- url_for('/pcb/') %>">
      <span>02</span>
      <strong>PCB 设计</strong>
      <small>原理图、封装、布局布线、打样、焊接、调试问题和版本记录。</small>
    </a>
    <a class="module-card feature-projects" href="<%- url_for('/projects/') %>">
      <span>03</span>
      <strong>项目作品</strong>
      <small>课程设计、硬件小作品、嵌入式实验、通信系统和完整项目复盘。</small>
    </a>
    <a class="module-card feature-life" href="<%- url_for('/life/') %>">
      <span>04</span>
      <strong>生活与作品</strong>
      <small>摄影、模型、旅行、读书、随笔，以及不那么工程但很个人的内容。</small>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-grid">
  <div class="section-main">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Recent Updates</p>
      <h2>最近记录</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="post-list">
      <% site.posts.sort('date', -1).limit(6).forEach(function(post) { %>
        <article class="post-card">
          <time datetime="<%= post.date.format('YYYY-MM-DD') %>"><%= post.date.format('YYYY.MM.DD') %></time>
          <h3><a href="<%- url_for(post.path) %>"><%= post.title %></a></h3>
          <p><%= strip_html(post.excerpt || post.content).replace(/\s+/g, ' ').substring(0, 118) %></p>
        </article>
      <% }) %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <aside class="module-rail">
    <div class="section-heading compact">
      <p class="eyebrow">Quick Access</p>
      <h2>快速入口</h2>
    </div>
    <a class="rail-link" href="<%- url_for('/about/') %>">关于我和这个站点</a>
    <a class="rail-link" href="<%- url_for('/archives/') %>">按时间查看全部文章</a>
    <a class="rail-link" href="<%- url_for('/links/') %>">常用链接与工具</a>
  </aside>
</section>
